  "_comment": [
    "Every string the annotatable document reader (T141) shows the candidate.",
    "",
    "The reader's language is the candidate's; the document's is the employer's.",
    "Same entry shape and the same completeness and staleness checks as",
    "`catalogue.json`; kept apart so the results page and the reader do not share a",
    "diff. Stamp after translating with `integral.strings.stamp`, never to make",
    "a red gate green."
  ],
